Description:
uBlock Origin - An efficient blocker for Chromium and Firefox. Fast and lean.

Local Modifications:
Integrated as non-removable FocusBlock; black-and-white Focus UI, Russian
localization, bundled assets, a stable component key, and a persistent
default-on master switch independent from per-site controls.
